{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/extras/a9f90b5b352b784b2b5162d93afa0fb3.poster.avif?t=1770181600\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/extras/a9f90b5b352b784b2b5162d93afa0fb3.webm?t=1770181600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/extras/a9f90b5b352b784b2b5162d93afa0fb3.mp4?t=1770181600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Heartbeat House: Hong Kong</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Love is not an experiment.<br>It\u2019s a reality.</strong><br>At least, that\u2019s what the show claims.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready for a romance experience with true Hong Kong flavor?<br>A brand-new dating reality show \u2014 <strong>Heartbeat House: Hong Kong</strong> \u2014 is now on air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not Netflix.<br>This is not YouTube.<br>This is a villa in Hong Kong, where <strong>eight young adults</strong> live together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They eat, chat, date, flirt, argue, and fall in love.<br>Sometimes it turns into a love triangle.<br>Sometimes, it feels like destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And you are there, too.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/extras/3d6937489426e9482c2e47bd651e1bda.poster.avif?t=1770181600\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/extras/3d6937489426e9482c2e47bd651e1bda.webm?t=1770181600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/extras/3d6937489426e9482c2e47bd651e1bda.mp4?t=1770181600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What You\u2019ll Do Here</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(And What You Might Regret)</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Freedom of Romance</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who do you want to date?<br>The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a game that forces you into loving a single character.<br>You can take the initiative, respond passively,<br>or test the boundaries between multiple relationships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The show won\u2019t stop you.<br>It will simply\u2026 remember your choices.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Branches Beyond Control</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main story is romance.<br>The side stories are life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character hides a past they don\u2019t easily talk about.<br>Some secrets only surface when you make the wrong choice.<br>Some conversations feel normal the first time \u2014<br>and unsettling the second.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you play only once and walk away,<br>you will miss more than you realize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/extras/ce42851339efda73130bde655d518d1b.poster.avif?t=1770181600\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/extras/ce42851339efda73130bde655d518d1b.webm?t=1770181600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/extras/ce42851339efda73130bde655d518d1b.mp4?t=1770181600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Truly \u201cHong Kong\u201d Stage</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Real-World Inspired Locations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The villa, streets, restaurants, and night views<br>are all inspired by real Hong Kong locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you eat a bowl of wonton noodles in the game,<br>you might suddenly wonder \u2014<br>why does this feel so familiar, yet so unreal?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full Cantonese Voice Acting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All dialogue is fully voiced in authentic Cantonese.<br>Not standardized dubbing \u2014 real Hong Kong voices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll hear familiar tones, pauses, and casual remarks\u2026<br>and occasionally,<br>a voice that feels like it shouldn\u2019t be there.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hand-Drawn Character Art</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All character portraits are hand-drawn by human artists.<br>Expressions, eye movements, subtle emotions \u2014 nothing is decoration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At times,<br>you may feel like certain characters<br>are looking at you, not the script.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/extras/87ba2d77bdad2f311e9507c28bd7d022.poster.avif?t=1770181600\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/extras/87ba2d77bdad2f311e9507c28bd7d022.webm?t=1770181600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/extras/87ba2d77bdad2f311e9507c28bd7d022.mp4?t=1770181600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why Play <i>Heartbeat House: Hong Kong</i>?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because it\u2019s more than a dating game.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience interactions and rivalries like a real dating reality show</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel sweetness, jealousy, unease, regret, and emotions you can\u2019t quite explain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in Hong Kong\u2019s atmosphere, like watching an unedited TV show</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Close the game at 3 a.m., only to realize the scenes haven\u2019t left your mind</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/extras/27fc4eae56df6ec97475473ca6e7756a.poster.avif?t=1770181600\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/extras/27fc4eae56df6ec97475473ca6e7756a.webm?t=1770181600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/extras/27fc4eae56df6ec97475473ca6e7756a.mp4?t=1770181600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Romance \u2014 and a Show</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Heartbeat House: Hong Kong</i> is not a typical \u201cPPT-style\u201d visual novel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices will be answered.<br>Characters will remember what you say.<br>The atmosphere may feel relaxed \u2014 but it isn\u2019t entirely safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the screen flickers,<br>if dialogue pauses strangely,<br>if you begin to wonder whether this is really just a game \u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please relax. Keep dating.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The show is still ongoing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/extras/c7d4f347a36a06daadb44a8ef86f0442.poster.avif?t=1770181600\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/extras/c7d4f347a36a06daadb44a8ef86f0442.webm?t=1770181600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/extras/c7d4f347a36a06daadb44a8ef86f0442.mp4?t=1770181600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"[Wins the Heart of the Beauty]","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4131900/4ec3775886d5c69d087d1a283f94499ad07ae18d.jpg"},{"name":"[FamilyZone]","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4131900/25dfd14143568cdcb8519802d2f3197593d67bd6.jpg"},{"name":"[I've Always Been Here]","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4131900/7cad20efd709d8ed4c279a9ddaf08ad62e09a272.jpg"},{"name":"[What Happened to the Promised Happiness?]","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4131900/8702109d46f68ec392d2f3c4082eefd485d0d741.jpg"},{"name":"[One spring night is priceless]","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4131900/4dffa22617aed089f5aed2a3e13ec6afac19bd32.jpg"},{"name":"[She Is Far Away]","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4131900/b761be0f8199c2285df385e8aa45a03ec6859d23.jpg"},{"name":"[You Belong Only to Me]","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4131900/80a397bec19d003af039104cdf7b0ce900ae4d1f.jpg"},{"name":"[Still Not Over It]","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4131900/836cf733cd47398eb2465cb706393f5dbb7e1fd3.jpg"},{"name":"[Automatic Withdrawal]","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4131900/15af97580bbdf34566f0bb99b465855042784c68.jpg"},{"name":"[Like a Dream]","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4131900/ec93e52a8bf9e1bab9935c9e2dd9d9d3ac090585.jpg"}],"total":39},"background":"https://store.ak