walk away,<br>you will miss more than you realize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/extras/ce42851339efda73130bde655d518d1b.poster.avif?t=1770181600\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/extras/ce42851339efda73130bde655d518d1b.webm?t=1770181600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/extras/ce42851339efda73130bde655d518d1b.mp4?t=1770181600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Truly \u201cHong Kong\u201d Stage</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Real-World Inspired Locations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The villa, streets, restaurants, and night views<br>are all inspired by real Hong Kong locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you eat a bowl of wonton noodles in the game,<br>you might suddenly wonder \u2014<br>why does this feel so familiar, yet so unreal?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full Cantonese Voice Acting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All dialogue is fully voiced in authentic Cantonese.<br>Not standardized dubbing \u2014 real Hong Kong voices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll hear familiar tones, pauses, and casual remarks\u2026<br>and occasionally,<br>a voice that feels like it shouldn\u2019t be there.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hand-Drawn Character Art</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All character portraits are hand-drawn by human artists.<br>Expressions, eye movements, subtle emotions \u2014 nothing is decoration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At times,<br>you may feel like certain characters<br>are looking at you, not the script.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati